<</Title(On 14 May 2026, it was officially confirmed that Retford United would return to the Northern Counties East League, competing in the Premier Division during the 2026/27 season. On Friday 9th October 2026, following four highly successful seasons at the helm, Ryan Hindley tendered his resignation as manager after being presented with an opportunity to take charge of Step 3 side Ilkeston Town. It was an opportunity he felt he could not turn down, bringing an end to a memorable chapter in the club\220s history. His departure saw assistant manager Jas Colliver step up to take charge of the first team, marking the beginning of a new era at Cannon Park)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 898 0 R/Next 814 0 R>>
